# Variables:
#   $partner (string) - a company name, e.g. Acme
# $partner is a company name and stays in its original form. If your language changes a name’s ending after ‘from’, rephrase the sentence so the name can stay unchanged.
partner-download-language-not-available = Muat turun { -brand-name-firefox } ini daripada { $partner } tidak tersedia dalam bahasa anda. Anda masih boleh memuat turun { -brand-name-firefox } menggunakan butang di bawah.

# Variables:
